---
/**
 * ChallengesSection - Technical gap and difficulty explanation section.
 * Positioned after Vision/Mission to contextualize why infrastructure is needed.
 */
---

<section class="section section-challenges" id="challenges" aria-labelledby="challenges-heading">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="challenges-card reveal">
      <div class="challenges-header">
        <p class="section-kicker">FROM LOCAL MODELS TO REAL PRODUCTS</p>
        <h2 id="challenges-heading">Running a model locally is <em>only the beginning.</em></h2>
        <p class="challenges-intro">
          Shipping product-grade, privacy-first AI requires far more than weights on a device. It demands solving four key technical challenges:
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="challenges-grid">
        <article class="challenge-item">
          <div class="challenge-num">01</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Runtime lifecycle</h3>
            <p>Model management, hardware compatibility, dynamic switching & zero-downtime updates.</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="challenge-item">
          <div class="challenge-num">02</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Observability & telemetry</h3>
            <p>Performance tracking, latency metrics, accuracy signals & memory profiling without privacy leakage.</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="challenge-item">
          <div class="challenge-num">03</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Hardware adaptation</h3>
            <p>RAM/VRAM constraints, resident memory optimization & thermal management on desktop and mobile.</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="challenge-item">
          <div class="challenge-num">04</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Developer ergonomics</h3>
            <p>Unified OpenAI-compatible APIs, reliable local IPC & intuitive user experiences.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section-challenges {
    padding: clamp(60px, 8vw, 110px) 0;
  }

  .challenges-card {
    padding: clamp(32px, 4vw, 56px);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: var(--surface-card);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  }

  .challenges-header {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-10);
  }

  .challenges-header h2 {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-3);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 2.5vw, 2.2rem);
    line-height: 1.18;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .challenges-intro {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    font-size: var(--text-body-lg);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .challenges-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-6) var(--space-8);
  }

  .challenge-item {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .challenge-num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent-blue);
    background: #edf2ff;
    padding: 4px 8px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-top: 3px;
  }

  .challenge-item h3 {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-1);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .challenge-item p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    font-size: var(--text-small);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .challenges-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-5);
    }
  }
</style>
